      "content": "that's a great start, very elegant. the flow is definitely there.\n\ni just ran it through the client's tool and the score was actually pretty low—it's only flagging like 8-9 keyword hits. the client is gonna be pretty annoyed if it doesn't hit a higher number. they basically told me if we can get the count up significantly, it'll help them rank much higher in search.\n\ncan you try another version? maybe beef it up a bit with those keywords so the score is higher, but please—try to keep it sounding like a luxury brand. i really don't want it to look like we just spammed the words, it's gotta be subtle but effective.",
      "source": "evaluator"
